Proc_ERP:RecordTest         	:4 Parameter, Sends to RecordError()  
--RecordTest("Record Test Data.", PROGRAM(), LINENO(1),"Long Message") 
*uses a local Errors VFP table, then Send_HTML_Email() and PACK
*Email to David.Kirchner@hpalloy.com (The Raptor@HPAlloys.com was getting over GoDaddy limit per hour)
*Does not get stored in HPAlloy.dbo.Errors.

**************************************************************************
*Record Error of Screen
TRY
	cRun = "ErrorCapture.EXE " +["Proc_ERP:RecordError: ]+SYS(0)
	+[" David.Kirchner@Windfall.HPA.local ]
	RUN /N &cRun
CATCH
ENDTRY



